{"script":"s_4_5_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]唉？我父亲？你们的意思是……[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（将委托内容告诉菲奥努拉。）","tag":"tag_3"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show][cm]什么！居然为了这点小事就找上你们两位英雄？真是岂有此理！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]喵呜！你、你不要突然这么激动啦！又吓我一跳！真是的，这父女简直一个样……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2p","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]啊……不…不好意思，是我失礼了。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"所以……你遇到了什么麻烦吗？","tag":"tag_8"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show][cm]麻烦……其实也谈不上什么麻烦，只是我自己有些小问题而已。这问题小到根本就犯不上让两位英雄过来……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]就是……我……我的样貌在众人眼里看来，似乎有些……凶悍。如果凶悍的面庞能震慑犯人倒没什么，可惜我脱下面具后，总是会吓到身边的人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]无论是大牢里的同事，还是金弦之厅的孩子，都会被我吓到。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]可我明明想成为一个淑女的啊。虽然我是典狱长，但那只是工作，我可不是那种无情凶狠的恶魔啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]（你刚刚的表现可一点都不淑女吧……）[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"可你为什么不告诉你父亲呢？","tag":"tag_28"},{"text":"这也不算太难以启齿的事情吧。","tag":"tag_28"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show][cm]你们是不了解我父亲啦……我母亲从小就去世，是我父亲独自把我带大的。他没有把我交给别的家族收养，我是金弦之厅少有的，由亲生父亲单独养大的孩子。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]因此我父亲对我非常溺爱，生怕我受到一点点委屈。我还记得我小时候曾被一截树枝划伤了手臂，他就直接用斧子把那大树给砍了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]要是他知道我因为面貌凶悍而被人误解，恐怕也会找人到处澄清求情吧……那我的脸可丢大了。所以你明白我为什么要瞒着他了吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]（……那人好像真做得出来这种事……）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]额……问题倒是明白了。不过我们既然接受了你父亲的委托，就一定要帮你解决这个问题。可我们也不擅长解决这个问题啊……我只会打架……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]没关系，是老爷子糊涂了。我会把报酬给你们的，辛苦你们白跑一趟了。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"不必了。","tag":"tag_23"},{"text":"我有办法。","tag":"tag_23"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]你有办法了？你打算怎么做？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"去找嘉莉缇吧。","tag":"tag_25"},{"text":"某个受欢迎的人一定有办法的。","tag":"tag_25"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show][cm]你是说……宴会大师？她确实是个开朗的人，而且也确实很受欢迎。不过找她真的有用吗？而且要麻烦两位为我这点小事奔波，实在是不太好意思……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]怎么着我们也接受了你爸的委托，当然要帮到底啦。等失败了再想办法嘛，就算最后也不行至少也得努力一下。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"典狱长菲奥努拉","text":"[show]好吧，我知道了。大牢里的工作都完成了，我跟你们一起去找嘉莉缇吧。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"你父亲让我们来看看你。"}